content:
The tool call format must be correct JSON and no extra characters. I wrote with > at end. Need proper JSON and close tags. Should be:

{
 "tool_name": "validate_smiles",
 "arguments": {"smiles": "COC(=O)C1=CC=C(C=C1)CC(C)"}
}

But format: <action>validate_smiles</action>
<action_input>{"smiles": "COC(=O)C1=CC=C(C=C1)CC(C)"} </action_input>

Make sure no extra spaces? Should be fine.
